734
00:56:41,460 --> 00:56:44,060
Because now, of
course, this sum here

735
00:56:44,060 --> 00:56:49,730
is less than the sum of
the absolute values k

736
00:56:49,730 --> 00:56:53,500
equal to m plus 1 to n.

737
00:56:53,500 --> 00:56:56,420
And then we take
the absolute value

738
00:56:56,420 --> 00:57:00,510
in under the summation
sign, like this.

739
00:57:00,510 --> 00:57:04,740
But now we can use
our condition here.

740
00:57:04,740 --> 00:57:11,700
So this thing here is less than
or equal to the sum here from k

741
00:57:11,700 --> 00:57:16,580
equal to m plus 1 up to n of Mk.

742
00:57:22,260 --> 00:57:29,880
But those guys, this is just
a sequence of real numbers.

743
00:57:29,880 --> 00:57:30,880
This is not a function.

744
00:57:30,880 --> 00:57:32,380
It's just real numbers.

745
00:57:32,380 --> 00:57:33,900
And they converge.

746
00:57:33,900 --> 00:57:36,020
So this means that--

747
00:57:36,020 --> 00:57:39,430
so this means that given--

748
00:57:39,430 --> 00:57:45,670
this means that you have-- that
