750
00:57:54,190 --> 00:58:06,400
So given-- so given--

751
00:58:09,630 --> 00:58:13,830
so given epsilon
greater than 0, there

752
00:58:13,830 --> 00:58:19,510
exists a capital N
such that if m here

753
00:58:19,510 --> 00:58:28,870
is bigger than capital N,
then the sum here of the tail,

754
00:58:28,870 --> 00:58:37,230
this thing here, up to
anything else of this Mk,

755
00:58:37,230 --> 00:58:38,890
that this is less than epsilon.

756
00:58:41,410 --> 00:58:44,470
And so you see that
this is really saying--

757
00:58:44,470 --> 00:58:50,450
so this implies that
